  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><strong>复古RPG字体</strong></span></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">简介</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">这款复古RPG风格字体清晰易读，将进一步提升您的原版游戏体验。最初为<a style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a>整合包制作，现已公开发布！<br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">基于Daymarius的<a style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.fontriver.com%252ffont%252fretro_gaming%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">复古游戏</a>字体修改</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">该字体遵循自由字体许可协议</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/769/583/retro-rpg-font.PNG\" width=\"1078\" height=\"485\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><strong>游戏截图</strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/769/585/2023-12-05_12.png\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/769/586/2023-12-05_12.png\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/769/584/2023-12-05_12.png\" width=\"1920\" height=\"&quot;1080\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即租用服务器与好友联机！点击<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>或下方横幅，使用优惠码<strong>GAMERPOTION</strong>可享75折！</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/